Subject: Port "Resolve conflicts for functions introduced in Android API level 35" into 3.8.8
Author: Vasyl Gello <vasek.gello@gmail.com>

Android NDK r27 and later introduced inconsistency in Android timezone handling:
https://mail.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-gnulib/2024-09/msg00024.html

As gnutls 3.8.8 still uses gnulib from a year ago, I had to backport the patch
to gnulib used in gnutls 3.8.8 and import that gnulib into gnutls via bootstrap
script.

