1. Build `localhost/gnutls-fedora40` container from `docker-fedora40`
in https://gitlab.com/gnutls/build-images

2. Inside the build container:

   ```
   cd /tmp/
   ```

   + Download gnutls 3.3.8 and find out which rolling commit gnulib-mirror
     submodule points to

   ```
   git clone https://github.com/gnutls/gnutls -b 3.8.8
   git clone https://github.com/libidn/gnulib-mirror
   cd gnutls
   git log -p -- gnulib/
   cd ..
   ```

   + Download the correct commit of gnulib-mirror and apply the commit above

   ```
   cd gnulib-mirror/
   git reset --hard bd1e981434c98751b1106a1744e77a27317b52b3
   git checkout -b gnutls-3.8.8-android35
   git log ORIG_HEAD 
   git am /tmp/thepatch.patch
   cd ..
   ```

   + Bootstrap the gnutls using gnulib-mirror directory

   ```
   cd gnutls/
   ./bootstrap --no-git --gnulib-srcdir=../gnulib-mirror --copy --skip-po
   ```

   + Build the tarball using the commands from `doc-dist.Fedora` in
     https://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml

   ```
   mkdir -p po/.reference
   CFLAGS="-std=c99 -O2 -g" dash ./configure --disable-gcc-warnings --cache-file $CCACHE_FILE --prefix=/usr --libdir=/usr/lib64 --disable-cxx --disable-non-suiteb-curves --enable-gtk-doc --disable-maintainer-mode --with-pkcs12-iter-count=10000
   make -j$BUILDJOBS -C doc stamp-vti
   make -j$BUILDJOBS -C doc stamp_enums
   make -j$BUILDJOBS
   make -j$BUILDJOBS -C doc gnutls.html
   texconfig rehash
   make -j$BUILDJOBS -C doc/latex gnutls.pdf
   DB2EPUBDIR=$(dirname $(find /usr/share/sgml/docbook/xsl-ns-stylesheets-*/epub/bin/ -name dbtoepub -print))
   PATH="$PATH:$DB2EPUBDIR" make -C doc gnutls.epub
   make -j$CHECKJOBS distcheck
   ```

   + Download official 3.8.8 tarball from https://www.gnupg.org/ftp/gcrypt/gnutls/v3.8/

   ```
   curl -LOJ https://www.gnupg.org/ftp/gcrypt/gnutls/v3.8/gnutls-3.8.8.tar.xz
   ```

